==Estonian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|et|fiu-fin-pro|*halpa}}, from {{der|et|gem-pro|*salwaz}}. Cognates include {{cog|fi|halpa||cheap}}, more distantly {{cog|en|sallow}}.

